Domain MigrantEducation
    documentation "The Migrant Education subdomain of the Alternative and Supplemental Services domain extends the StudentProgramAssociation to specify attributes specific to the Migrant Education program, such as the first date and the most recent entry of a student into the United States, the student's initial school entry date,and the student's last qualifying move."
